    <!-- Onboarding -->
    <string name="onboarding_explanation">To measure how much you use each app, Foco needs access to usage stats. Android only lets you enable it by hand, from Settings.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_open_settings">Open Settings</string>
    <string name="onboarding_hint">Find “Foco” in the list and enable the permission. When you come back here, the screen updates on its own.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_accessibility_explanation">To apply your daily limits, Foco needs its accessibility service: it is the only way to see which app is open and show the limit screen. Foco never reads screen content.</string>
